---
export const prerender = true

import SkillsMatrix from "../components/SkillsMatrix.astro"
import { skills } from "../data/skills"
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"

const title = "Résumé"
---

<BaseLayout title={title}>
  <h1>{title}</h1>

  <!-- Skip link remains -->
  <p><a href="#skills">Skip to skills</a></p>

  <!-- One-liner -->
  <p>
    Engineering Team Lead focused on platform, identity, and reliability. I ship boring‑by‑default, idiomatic
    systems that raise delivery velocity and cut cost.
  </p>

  <!-- At‑a‑glance facts (minimal, evergreen) -->
  <ul>
    <li>Location: Berlin (hybrid, 99% remote)</li>
    <li><strong>Focus:</strong> Identity & Platform · Reliability · Security</li>
    <!-- Optional later: Languages / Work authorization / Availability -->
  </ul>

  <section aria-labelledby="exp">
    <h2 id="exp">Experience</h2>

    <!-- Current role -->
    <article aria-labelledby="etl-platform">
      <header>
        <h3 id="etl-platform">Engineering Team Lead (Platform)</h3>
        <p>
          <time datetime="2022-10">Oct 2022</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
          <time>Present</time>
          · Berlin (hybrid, 99% remote)
        </p>
        <p>
          Lead platform modernization and reliability. Restarted stalled delivery, restored core systems, and
          embedded lasting service ownership.
        </p>
      </header>

      <p>Joined as Senior Software Engineer; promoted to Engineering Team Lead (Platform) in July 2024.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Restarted delivery after months of zero output; raised production deploys to ~15/month on regulated,
          QA-heavy services.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cut CI test suite time by 33% (wall‑clock) and 13% (billable), saving significant developer hours
          and reducing compute cost.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reduced memory usage in the core Rails app by ~70% via YJIT & jemalloc tuning and targeted
          allocation fixes, allowing to save running-cost by resource downscale.
        </li>
        <li>
          Removed scaling bottlenecks (SQL DML/DDL, read‑replica–safe patterns, PostgreSQL config) through
          production profiling and query optimization; shipped efficient Ruby/Rails paths.
        </li>
        <li>
          Scaled core platform services—identity & access (IDM), authentication/authorization, and HLS video
          delivery—a revenue-critical capability—improving security posture and reliability.
        </li>
        <li>
          Established clear service ownership via a squad ownership model, improving accountability and
          on‑call clarity.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led engineering inputs for first ISO/IEC 27001 audit—certified with zero non‑conformities; authored
          and refined SOPs. (<a
            href="https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html"
            target="_blank"
            rel="external nofollow noopener"
            aria-label="ISO/IEC 27001 — official overview (opens in a new tab)">ISO/IEC 27001 overview</a
          >)
        </li>
        <li>
          Hired and onboarded 2 engineers; coach a 3‑person team; drive cross‑squad alignment on IDM and video
          delivery initiatives.
        </li>

        <!-- TODO: Consider adding 1–2 org-scope bullets if accurate; fill metrics you have -->
        <!-- <li>Defined platform “paved roads” (golden paths) for services, CI/CD, and observability; reduced time-to-first-deploy by X%.</li> -->
        <!-- <li>Introduced service SLOs/error budgets and review cadence with product teams; lowered incident rate by X% and MTTR by Y%.</li> -->
      </ul>

      <details>
        <summary><strong>Full stack & tools</strong></summary>
        <ul>
          <li>Ruby · Ruby on Rails · RSpec · Sidekiq</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL · Query optimization · PostGIS (if relevant)</li>
          <li>TypeScript · Angular/React (as applicable) · Jest · Cypress</li>
          <li>GraphQL · REST</li>
          <li>Docker · AWS · GitHub Actions</li>
          <li>ISO/IEC 27001</li>
          <li>Scrum · Jira · Confluence</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article aria-labelledby="ruby-dev">
      <header>
        <h3 id="ruby-dev">Ruby Developer</h3>
        <p>
          <time datetime="2022-05">May 2022</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
          <time datetime="2022-07">Jul 2022</time>
          · Remote
        </p>
      </header>

      <p>Short-term engagement during probation period.</p>

      <details>
        <summary><strong>Stack</strong></summary>
        <ul>
          <li>Ruby · Ruby on Rails</li>
          <li>RSpec</li>
          <li>JavaScript · TypeScript · React</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL · HTML5</li>
          <li>Linux · nginx · Docker · git</li>
          <li>Cypress</li>
          <li>Agile/Scrum · CI/CD</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article aria-labelledby="fsd">
      <header>
        <h3 id="fsd">Full Stack Developer</h3>
        <p>
          <time datetime="2017-09">Sep 2017</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
          <time datetime="2022-02">Feb 2022</time>
          · Berlin
        </p>
        <p>
          Sole engineer in &lt;10-person agency. Led the relaunch of an interactive city portal and supported
