        </li>
        <li>
          Migrated to a new CRM: rescued and transformed legacy data, customized workflows, trained
          sales/founders, and enabled transactional email and funnel features.
        </li>
        <li>
          Achieved Google SERP #1 rankings for portal POI pages — often outranking official sites — making SEO
          a strong sales argument, especially for small B2B clients without online presence.
        </li>
        <li>
          Streamlined business processes with digital ordering/configuration of virtual tours; improved tour
          reliability by linting SVG floorplans with context-aware graph logic (ensuring hotspot
          reachability), and built staff-friendly backend tools.
        </li>
        <li>
          Introduced geospatial search (PostGIS) over ~50k records — enabled B2C users and B2B clients to find
          POIs and events within distance ranges, a first for the portal.
        </li>
        <li>
          Delivered custom Rails/CMS projects for city and state clients; acted as technical consultant in
          sales meetings and demos.
        </li>
        <li>Mentored a working student on development practices.</li>
      </ul>

      <details>
        <summary><strong>Stack</strong></summary>
        <ul>
          <li>Ruby · Ruby on Rails · RSpec</li>
          <li>JavaScript · TypeScript · Vue.js · Nuxt.js</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL · PostGIS</li>
          <li>HTML5 · SCSS · BEM</li>
          <li>Linux · nginx · Docker · git</li>
          <li>Ansible · Capistrano · CI/CD</li>
          <li>Monitoring (TICK stack, Sentry.io, UptimeRobot)</li>
          <li>SEO · Process optimization · Project/Product management</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article aria-labelledby="freelance17">
      <header>
        <h3 id="freelance">Freelance Developer</h3>
        <p>
          <time datetime="2017-05">May 2017</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
